  "scope_limits": [
    "Only local process-crash and injected-syscall/I/O recovery is proven; physical power loss, kernel/filesystem corruption and remote-runner behavior are not certified.",
    "No retention or deletion command is added; a missing segment cannot prove that no event was lost. C23 owns retention/audit metadata.",
    "AppendRecords and the one-shot --project-segments command are not atomic with a C16 commit and do not deduplicate; C18 owns index/checkpoint and a repeated command appends the same events again.",
    "No transport, mTLS terminator, authenticated ingest endpoint, HTTP API, UI or real sensor identity is added or claimed; the only new surface is the local one-shot projection command, which opens no listener.",
    "The command requires an existing C05 store, rejects overlapping storage/segment directories and writes no C05 receipt or ACK; a failed projection can leave durable segments behind, and the outcome reports that state or marks it unknown when no trustworthy snapshot exists.",
    "C28 capacity is unmeasured; C30 remains the full clean-host workflow/restart/restore gate.",
    "Browser regression ran on 127.0.0.1:4199 with a temporary Playwright config because canonical loopback ports were occupied; the same three browser tests passed."
